  villain maybe it's just me but i did  actually like some of the more mellow  moments here like kawaki at the grocery  store  that was pretty dope for some reason  just seeing konoha in a more downbeat  way but i do hope we get some more  action soon  and since we had a couple of more  downbeat preparatory chapters in a row  i'm expecting the next one to deliver on  some craziness now that the current  villains have been well introduced  along with the container and kawaki  seems to have made a definitive decision  that is clearly not what naruto wanted  as always let me know your thoughts on  this chapter and what you're most  excited to see happening next  if you do enjoy seeing these boruto  reviews and want to keep them coming  channel the hokage within and smash  that like button until it changes colors  if you haven't make this the video you  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications or you will  miss future naruto and boruto videos and  while you wait for the next chapter to  drop feel free to check out my growing  naruto slash borto playlist which  includes videos about all the otosuki  all the uzumaki all the kage and much  more  link to that is in the description and  until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

